@startuml myMusic-部署图
' ============================================================
' myMusic 部署图
' 建模范围：开发环境 → 生产环境规划 → 移动端打包
' ============================================================

title myMusic 系统部署图

' ────────────────────────────────────────────
' 开发环境 (当前)
' ────────────────────────────────────────────

node "开发者笔记本 (Windows 11)" as DevMachine {
    rectangle "Git 工作区" as Git {
        usecase "master 分支" as Master
        usecase "GitHub Remote\nhttps://github.com/Orlyi/myMusicRep" as GitHub
    }

    node "WebStorm / VS Code" as IDE

    rectangle "爬虫数据源" as SpidersNode {
        component "music_spider.py\n(音乐爬取)" as Spider1
        component "lyric_spider.py\n(歌词爬取)" as Spider2
        component "search_sprider.py\n(搜索爬取)" as Spider3
        database "music/\n(本地音乐文件)" as LocalMusic
    }

    node "web/ (React SPA)\nVite Dev Server\nlocalhost:5173" as WebDev {
        component "React 19\nReact Router v7" as ReactApp
        component "Zustand\n(stores)" as Zustand
        component "Howler.js\n(音频播放)" as Howler
        component "Axios Client\n(拦截器)" as AxiosClient
    }

    node "newMusic/ (FastAPI)\nUvicorn\nlocalhost:8000" as APIDev {
        component "FastAPI\n13 个路由模块" as FastAPIApp
        component "JWT Auth\n(bcrypt + jose)" as JWT
        component "StaticFiles\n(/static → uploads/)" as StaticSvr
        component "Swagger /docs\n(自动生成)" as Swagger
    }

    database "MySQL (本地)\nlocalhost:3306\nmyMusic 库" as MySQLDev {
        frame "22 张表" as AllTables {
            collections "users 域" as T1
            collections "music 域" as T2
            collections "interaction 域" as T3
            collections "history 域" as T4
        }
    }

    database "uploads/\n(头像等静态文件)" as UploadsDir
}

' 开发环境通信
Master --> GitHub : git push/pull
SpidersNode --> MySQLDev : 爬取 → 写入数据
WebDev --> APIDev : HTTP REST\nCORS *
ReactApp --> AxiosClient : 前端调用
AxiosClient --> APIDev : baseURL localhost:8000
APIDev --> MySQLDev : asyncmy\nSQLAlchemy 2.0 async
APIDev --> UploadsDir : 读写文件
FastAPIApp --> StaticSvr : 挂载 /static
FastAPIApp --> Swagger : /docs 端点
JWT --> FastAPIApp : Depends→get_current_user

' ────────────────────────────────────────────
' 生产环境规划 (虚线)
' ────────────────────────────────────────────

cloud "云服务器 (规划中)" as Cloud {
    node "Linux Server" as ProdServer {
        node "Nginx (反向代理)" as Nginx {

        }

        node "Docker Compose 编排" as Docker {
            node "web 容器\n(nginx:alpine)" as WebProd {
                artifact "Vite Build\n(dist/ 静态文件)" as BuildArtifact
            }

            node "newMusic 容器\n(python:3.12)" as APIProd {
                component "FastAPI\n(生产模式)" as FastAPIProd
                component "Gunicorn +\nUvicorn Workers" as Gunicorn
            }

            database "MySQL 容器\n(mysql:8.0)" as MySQLProd

            node "Capacitor 打包\n(Android APK)" as Capacitor {
                artifact "web/ build\n→ Android APK" as APK
            }
        }
    }
}

Nginx --> WebProd : static files (/)
Nginx --> APIProd : /api/* proxy_pass
APIProd --> MySQLProd : asyncmy
FastAPIProd --> Gunicorn : 多 worker

' 移动端
node "Android 设备" as Android {
    artifact "myMusic.apk" as APKFile
    component "Capacitor WebView" as WebView
}

Capacitor --> APKFile : 构建产出
APKFile --> Android : 安装
WebView --> FastAPIProd : HTTP API\n(同 web 端)

' ────────────────────────────────────────────
' 技术栈标注
' ────────────────────────────────────────────

note right of Docker
  <b>生产环境技术栈</b>
  • 反向代理：Nginx
  • 容器编排：Docker Compose
  • 前端部署：nginx:alpine 静态服务
  • 后端部署：Gunicorn + Uvicorn Workers
  • 数据库：MySQL 8.0
  • 移动端：Capacitor (开源 MIT)
  • CI/CD：(待定)
end note

note left of WebDev
  <b>前端技术栈</b>
  • React 19 + Vite 8
  • React Router v7
  • Axios 1.18
  • Howler.js 2.2
  • Lucide React 1.21
  • Zustand (规划中)
end note

note left of APIDev
  <b>后端技术栈</b>
  • FastAPI + Uvicorn
  • SQLAlchemy 2.0 async
  • asyncmy (MySQL 驱动)
  • Alembic (数据迁移)
  • JWT + bcrypt
  • Pydantic v2
end note

note bottom of MySQLDev
  <b>22 张数据表</b>
  ─────────────────
  <b>核心数据 (5)</b>：users, user_details,
  artists, songs, lyrics
  <b>聚合实体 (2)</b>：albums, playlists
  <b>关联表 (3)</b>：artist_sing_song,
  album_save_song, playlist_save_song
  <b>用户交互 (6)</b>：comments, messages,
  user_save_song, user_save_album,
  user_save_playlist, user_like_comment
  <b>社交 (2)</b>：user_follow_user,
  user_follow_artist
  <b>历史 (2)</b>：play_history, search_history
end note

@enduml
